# Exception (force-added with `git add -f`, then stays tracked):
#   build/circuit_js/circuit.wasm
# It pairs with the committed verification_key.json. The Phase-1 PoT
# is non-deterministic across machines, so CI cannot rebuild it
# without breaking the deployed VK.
#
# The proving key (build/account_age_pkey.zkey) is NOT tracked as of
# Phase B: at 249 k constraints it weighs ~169 MB, past GitHub's
# 100 MB limit. It pairs with the same ceremony as the committed VK
# and must be distributed out-of-band (release asset) or regenerated
# locally via scripts/setup.sh FORCE_REGEN=1 — note the regenerated
# VK then differs and the on-chain verifier must be redeployed.

# verification_key.json is committed at account_age/verification_key.json
